    "description": "Few bands inhibit the absolute epic atmospheric and ferocious presence that Cult of Fire does. A marriage of Hindu and Buddhist religious themes, Black Metal and musical prowess. This will play straight into the hands of our Church of Riffs, and will be one to remember!\nFrom tantric melodic super-riffing to bone-chilling harsh vocals. We will meditate on death, and the church will be basking in the sonic anthems of impious lacerated melodies.\nNever before has the Church of Riffs been closer to a portal to the underworld!",
